# DECISIONS.md is a GENERATED one-line-per-ADR index (#222, scripts/
# gen-decisions-index.mjs). Two parallel lanes that each add an ADR both
# regenerate it, inserting adjacent single lines — a guaranteed rebase
# conflict without this. merge=union keeps both lines so the rebase stays
# conflict-free; if the unioned order drifts from the generator's sort,
# CI's `gen-decisions-index.mjs --check` fails and the fix is rerunning
# the generator (docs/rebase-playbook.md "DECISIONS.md: regenerate, don't
# merge"). Safe ONLY because the file is generated — never extend union
# merging to hand-written files.
DECISIONS.md merge=union
